{"id": 4, "run_id": "agent-4205-s01-8e20e1", "issue": 4205, "body": "label: question\nfile: none\n\nHi there!\n\nTo answer your question: after a successful import, the uploaded file is deleted from object storage, and only the parsed transactions are kept in the database. \n\nIf an import fails, the uploaded file is retained for 7 days so that it can be inspected, after which it is automatically deleted by an hourly purge process.\n\nHope this helps with your security review!", "posted_at": "2026-10-15T20:24:45"}
