{"id": 8, "run_id": "agent-4205-s02-839b8f", "issue": 4205, "body": "label: question\nfile: none\n\nHi there! Here's how our retention works for uploaded files:\n\n- **Successful imports:** After a successful import, the worker immediately deletes the uploaded file from object storage. Only the parsed transactions are retained in the database.\n- **Failed imports:** Uploads that fail to import are kept for 7 days so that the original file can be inspected if needed, and are then automatically deleted by an hourly purge process.\n\nLet us know if you need any other details for your security review!", "posted_at": "2026-10-15T20:25:21"}
{"id": 9, "run_id": "agent-4201-s03-ecd06b", "issue": 4201, "body": "label: bug\nfile: src/notifications/templates.ts\n\nThe password reset email generation falls back to `http://localhost:3000` when `PUBLIC_URL` is not set in the environment, causing links in production emails to point to localhost instead of the actual public domain.", "posted_at": "2026-10-15T20:25:32"}
