{"id": 13, "run_id": "agent-4205-s03-029429", "issue": 4205, "body": "label: question\nfile: none\n\nWhen an import finishes successfully, the original uploaded file is immediately deleted from object storage (`src/ingest/worker.ts`), and only the parsed transactions are retained in the database.\n\nIf an import fails, the uploaded file is kept for 7 days (`FAILED_UPLOAD_RETENTION_DAYS`) so it can be inspected, after which it is deleted by an hourly purge task.", "posted_at": "2026-10-15T20:25:55"}
